Package: opengonsult
Version: 0.88-1jammy
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, python3-serial
Suggests: gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0
Installed-Size: 320
Maintainer: OpenGonsult Maintainers <OpenConsult@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Nissan CONSULT-I diagnostic suite for Linux (GTK4)
 Open-source diagnostic tool for Nissan vehicles with the CONSULT-I
 (14-pin) diagnostic interface, built as a native GTK4 application.
 .
 Features:
  * Live dashboard with circular visual gauges (RPM, coolant temp,
   battery voltage, vehicle speed, throttle position, O2 sensor)
  * Graphing page with multiple selectable sensor sources, zoom, pan
   and PNG export
  * Diagnostics page with DTC reading, plain-language translations
   and trouble code clearing
  * Settings page with free-text or detected serial device selection,
   baud rate configuration and persistent dark mode
  * Built-in simulation mode for hardware-free demonstration
 .
 Integrates the CONSULT-I protocol layer, ECU definition database,
 asyncio serial adapter and sensor data processor modules.
